direction: right
title: HotSpot GC Reachability & Root Sets

Roots: GC Root Set {
  style.stroke: "#38BDF8"
  R1: Active Thread Stack Local Variables
  R2: Metaspace Class Statics
  R3: JNI Global & Local Handles
  R4: JVM Internal Monitors & System Classes
}

LiveGraph: Live Reachable Object Graph {
  style.stroke: "#34D399"
  ObjA: Live Object A (Direct Stack Root Child)
  ObjB: Live Object B (Transitive Child)
  ObjC: Live Object C (Leaf Node)

  ObjA -> ObjB: objA.child { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
  ObjB -> ObjC: objB.child { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
}

DeadIsland: Island of Isolation (Unreachable) {
  style.stroke: "#EF4444"
  ObjD: Dead Object D
  ObjE: Dead Object E

  ObjD -> ObjE: cyclic reference { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
  ObjE -> ObjD: cyclic reference { style.stroke: "#EF4444" }
}

Roots.R1 -> LiveGraph.ObjA: Root Pointer { style.stroke: "#34D399" }
